    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Assigns records to tiles of a numeric field: quantiles, equal-sum Pareto bands, equal width, standard-deviation bands or manual cut points, optionally within groups.",
    "category": "Preparation",
    "subcategory": "Binning",
    "tags": [
        "tile",
